Revise the preceding draft to address the independent review below, then return the same complete draft JSON schema. Keep the supplied Greek unchanged. Preserve uncertainty and interpretive alternatives for readers; do not erase a source problem merely to pass review. Confirmed printed oddities are not necessarily OCR defects, but their interpretation must remain explicitly provisional. Any actual unresolved source corruption still blocks publication. Return fresh exact source quotations; no approval is implied by a suggested replacement.
